  "post_content": "<p>(34 fotos) El Ayuntamiento de Onda ha aprovechado este domingo la XVIII jornada europea de la cultura jud&iacute;a, bajo el lema Di&aacute;sporas, para promocionar su castillo y su centro hist&oacute;rico. El teniente de alcalde de Dinamizaci&oacute;n Econ&oacute;mica, &Aacute;ngel Badenas Don&iacute;s, ha indicado en la inauguraci&oacute;n de los actos en el Museo de Arqueolog&iacute;a del castillo, que &ldquo;con esta iniciativa, el consistorio invita a descubrir el patrimonio art&iacute;stico y cultural jud&iacute;o de Onda&rdquo;.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaculturaljueva17/img_6285.jpg\" alt=\"img_6285\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaculturaljueva17/img_6288.jpg\" alt=\"img_6288\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaculturaljueva17/img_6289.jpg\" alt=\"img_6289\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaculturaljueva17/img_6291.jpg\" alt=\"img_6291\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaculturaljueva17/img_6293.jpg\" alt=\"img_6293\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaculturaljueva17/img_6294.jpg\" alt=\"img_6294\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaculturaljueva17/img_6295.jpg\" alt=\"img_6295\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaculturaljueva17/img_6296.jpg\" alt=\"img_6296\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaculturaljueva17/img_6299.j